<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's CGD cuts prime rate to 9.125 pct.</title>
<headline>Portugal's CGD cuts prime rate to 9.125 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's state-owned Caixa Geral de Depositos said on Friday that it was cutting its prime lending rate 25 basis points to 9.125 percent, effective April 14.  </p>
<p>The move followed the Bank of Portugal's decision to cut its repurchase pact rate 20 basis points to 6.3 percent and lower its drain rate, the level at which it absorbs market funds, by 40 basis points to 5.8 percent on Friday.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
